      "text": "4. Perusal of the record would reveal that the lis involved in this case had already been dealt with by this Court extensively vide common order dated 05.07.2021 in Crl.P. No.152 of 2020 and batch which was reported in Mohd. Jameel Ahmed v. State of Telangana1 and also vide common order dated 10.06.2022 in Crl.P.No.5619 of 2020 and batch.\n2022 CriLJ 642.\n5.",
